{
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "一根价格 bar：`[interval_start, interval_end)`，`available_time >= interval_end`。\n\n`volume`（ADR-0054 §4，可选）：该 bar 的成交数量（`>= 0`）。它是 bar 收盘后才知道的量，\n只被模拟器用来界定\"这根 bar 市场能承载多少\"，**从不**进入策略或风控的决策输入\n（`StrategyRequest` / `RiskRequest` 不含 `PriceBar`），因此不构成 C-L1 泄漏。为 `None` 时\n从载荷中省略：既有 `PriceBar` 与 `BacktestRequest` 的内容哈希逐位不变。",
  "properties": {
    "schema_version": {
      "default": "2.6.0",
      "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
      "title": "Schema Version",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "instrument": {
      "minLength": 1,
      "title": "Instrument",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "interval_start": {
      "format": "date-time",
      "title": "Interval Start",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "interval_end": {
      "format": "date-time",
      "title": "Interval End",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "available_time": {
      "format": "date-time",
      "title": "Available Time",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "open": {
      "gt": 0,
      "pattern": "^(?!^[-+.]*$)[+-]?0*\\d*\\.?\\d*$",
      "title": "Open",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "high": {
      "gt": 0,
      "pattern": "^(?!^[-+.]*$)[+-]?0*\\d*\\.?\\d*$",
      "title": "High",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "low": {
      "gt": 0,
      "pattern": "^(?!^[-+.]*$)[+-]?0*\\d*\\.?\\d*$",
      "title": "Low",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "close": {
      "gt": 0,
      "pattern": "^(?!^[-+.]*$)[+-]?0*\\d*\\.?\\d*$",
      "title": "Close",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "volume": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "ge": 0,
          "pattern": "^(?!^[-+.]*$)[+-]?0*\\d*\\.?\\d*$",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Volume"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "instrument",
    "interval_start",
    "interval_end",
    "available_time",
    "open",
    "high",
    "low",
    "close"
  ],
  "title": "PriceBar",
  "type": "object"
}
